<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/achsab" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4325914); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4325914&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606637278" alt="achsab" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4325914)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/achsab" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4325914); return false;">achsab</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587661938 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">23 Apr 2020 17:12</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00287/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一支██牌中性笔，其笔盖在落至地面后将会消失，并且使笔的使用者产生强烈的寻找其的冲动，在笔的主人更换后笔盖会重新出现于新主人的附近<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Dr.Leon的办公桌上<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被存放于site-47低危物品收容柜内<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>然后为了检查同一批次中性笔有无异常，我被逼着摔了一个星期的笔盖-Dr.Leon</em><br />
<em>这是你找笔盖找了五个小时文书工作一笔没动的报应-site主管尹██</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00287" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00287" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00287-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leonswangsx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6522014); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6522014&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606637278" alt="LeonSwangsx" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6522014)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leonswangsx" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6522014); return false;">LeonSwangsx</a></span></p>
